{"sourceUrl":"https://aii.caas.cn/yjspy/zsxx/3023e1309e3b4e29aaf9b38819ce4888.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:36.072279+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://aii.caas.cn/yjspy/zsxx/3023e1309e3b4e29aaf9b38819ce4888.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://aii.caas.cn/images/2022-05/26e5e90c69c34149962aa549bbfd8271.jpg\"/></p>\n<p>\n        <br/>  中国农业信息研究所是以农业信息学科研创新、产品开发、应用推广为主体科研任务的公益性单位。经过多年的科研实践和研究积累，特别是近十年来，在农业信息分析、农业信息技术和农业信息管理三大学科领域加强了科研创新，取得一批的科研成果，在全国农业信息科研领域处于领导地位。\n                                     </p>\n</div>","textSha256":"d96368ed871e6ea343e46e5737b55152aed0817d41712fd44cfeae12c493652e","textLength":130,"sourceSha256":"d6c4187e7ac452f05ce1332ad2ebff82f42076cd443128cb73d11373501a6147","selector":"article-like:gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2bc29940d5c5413507d4","title":"2026年中国农业科学院农业信息研究所2027年接收推荐免试研究生公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:36.072279+00:00"}
